          "yaw": 3.046104420392922,
          "pitch": -0.04424965572621531,
          "title": "BMW Trust",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"407\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 300; font-size: 13px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">“BMW Trust” isn’t a single formal product, but it arises in several contexts related to reliability, service, and reputation. Possible meanings include:</p><ul data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"1390\"><li data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"526\"><p data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"526\"><strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"442\">Customer trust / Confidence</strong>&nbsp;— how customers trust BMW for reliability, safety, service quality, and fairness.</p></li><li data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"677\"><p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"562\">Warranty &amp; guarantee policies</strong>&nbsp;— BMW’s warranties (engine, rust, paint) that assure buyers of protection.&nbsp;<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.bmw.in/en/topics/owners/warranty-policy.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.bmw.in/en/topics/owners/warranty-policy.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\">BMW India</a></span></span></p></li><li data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"930\"><p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"930\"><strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"718\">After-sales &amp; service transparency</strong>&nbsp;— initiatives like BMW’s Smart Video in India that show repair/maintenance needs via video so customers approve repairs online, increasing transparency and building trust.&nbsp;<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.press.bmwgroup.com/india/article/detail/T0301635EN/a-new-benchmark-in-customer-delight%3A-bmw-india-aftersales-introduces-bmw-smart-video?language=en&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.press.bmwgroup.com/india/article/detail/T0301635EN/a-new-benchmark-in-customer-delight%3A-bmw-india-aftersales-introduces-bmw-smart-video?language=en&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\">BMW Group PressClub</a></span></span></p></li><li data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1176\"><p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"1176\"><strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"968\">Breakdown &amp; Accident Management</strong>&nbsp;— BMW’s services offering roadside assistance, accident support, ensuring the owner is cared for in emergencies. Supposed to build trust that BMW stands by the driver.&nbsp;<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.bmw.in/en/topics/owners/service-and-warranty-original/accident-management.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.bmw.in/en/topics/owners/service-and-warranty-original/accident-management.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\">BMW India</a></span></span></p></li><li data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1390\"><p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1390\"><strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1209\">Loyalty / rewards programs</strong>&nbsp;— such as&nbsp;<em data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1237\">BMW Joy Rewards</em>&nbsp;in India, offering discounts on service depending on years of ownership. That rewards trust and long-term usage.&nbsp;<span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a href=\"https://www.bmw.in/en/topics/owners/joy-rewards.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" alt=\"https://www.bmw.in/en/topics/owners/joy-rewards.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\">BMW India</a></span></span></p></li></ul>"
